note v1.4 interop demo: emit a Laravel route, controller, and Blade page,
note then scaffold a small project skeleton.
note Usage: python3 jesun.py examples/php_demo.jc
note Writes ./my-blog/ (routes.php, app/PostController.php, views/home.blade.php).

bring in "php"

show php_route with "get" and "/posts" and "PostController@index"
show ""
show controller with "PostController" and ["index", "show"]
show ""
show blade_page with "My Blog" and "<h1>Welcome</h1>"
show ""
paths is php_scaffold with "my-blog"
show "Wrote:"
for each p in paths
    show "  " + p
